<!--
  The status-bar icon for both notifications.

  It is an app-owned resource rather than a framework drawable on purpose: `startForeground` rejects
  a foreground notification whose small icon the platform cannot resolve, and depending on a
  framework drawable is exactly the kind of thing that works on one API level and not the next. The
  shape is a plain ring, which reads at status-bar size.
-->
